      "retweet": {
        "id": "2057205982309265446",
        "text": "One great thing about spaceflight is that the scenic route is often the fastest path to where you’re going. \n\nAlso great to see the Psyche spacecraft healthy and enjoying its journey to the 16 Psyche asteroid (launched on Falcon Heavy in Oct 2023, arrives summer 2029). Can’t wait to see what a $10 quadrillion asteroid looks like 🤩",
